{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15890","headline":"独孤常州北亭 · 张南史","name":"独孤常州北亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北洫敞高明，凭轩见野情。\n朝回五马迹，更胜百花名。\n海树凝烟远，湖田见鹤清。\n云光侵素壁，水影荡闲楹。\n俗赖褰帷谒，人欢倒屣迎。\n始能崇结构，独有谢宣城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}